(7422886, 1171393, 94815, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites with its other worldly possibilities. I think it would work much, much better with a very tight crop that would let the mirror world take an important visual role in the image. As it is, it still catches the eye with its fingers and face popping out. 7</td>', 'This is one of my favorites with its other worldly possibilities. I think it would work much, much better with a very tight crop that would let the mirror world take an important visual role in the image. As it is, it still catches the eye with its fingers and face popping out. 7', '2015-12-17 22:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
