(7422903, 1171393, 113591, '<td valign="top">What''s the matter with you, this is perfect. It must be in B&amp;W, as you''ll most probably have too many distractions in colour, so that the idea becomes a lesser part of the mage. Here it is central and immediate. <br/> <br/>The tree stump just a co-incidence? Never. <br/> <br/>Thank you for your stories.<br/> <br/></td>', 'What''s the matter with you, this is perfect. It must be in B&W, as you''ll most probably have too many distractions in colour, so that the idea becomes a lesser part of the mage. Here it is central and immediate.  The tree stump just a co-incidence? Never.  Thank you for your stories. ', '2015-12-18 01:07:01.000000', NULL, 0),
