(7422906, 1171393, 98565, '<td valign="top">I saw it on the internet too and wondered if I could manage to create a scene like that some day - I can imagine all the struggles you had to overcome very well. The result is just perfect!!! Congrats!<br/>And your daughter is a beautiful model with her very natural smile</td>', 'I saw it on the internet too and wondered if I could manage to create a scene like that some day - I can imagine all the struggles you had to overcome very well. The result is just perfect!!! Congrats!And your daughter is a beautiful model with her very natural smile', '2015-12-18 01:24:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7422907, 1171614, 113591, '<td valign="top">This one got to me. This time round I didn''t like it getting to me. Strange how that happens. Some personal connection problem that I''m not even aware of, and, because of my upbeat personality/lack of depth, luckily for me, do not have to dwell on. <br/> <br/>Still, I remember specifically thinking that I''m not going to give it a good mark. So it''s a good, interesting image, that connected so well with me that you got nailed. Sorry.</td>', 'This one got to me. This time round I didn''t like it getting to me. Strange how that happens. Some personal connection problem that I''m not even aware of, and, because of my upbeat personality/lack of depth, luckily for me, do not have to dwell on.  Still, I remember specifically thinking that I''m not going to give it a good mark. So it''s a good, interesting image, that connected so well with me that you got nailed. Sorry.', '2015-12-18 01:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7422908, 1171623, 98565, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Looks like you visited a workshop for framing<br/>I also like the two female heads that show up like an extra bonus in the mirror. Very cleverly executed - congrats!</td>', 'Wonderful! Looks like you visited a workshop for framingI also like the two female heads that show up like an extra bonus in the mirror. Very cleverly executed - congrats!', '2015-12-18 01:29:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7422909, 1171565, 113591, '<td valign="top">Lydia got it right. The body-language of the person pulls the viewer in.<br/> <br/>You do manage to get that part into most of your images. We become immersed in your view.<br/> <br/>Thanks.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Lydia got it right. The body-language of the person pulls the viewer in. You do manage to get that part into most of your images. We become immersed in your view. Thanks. ', '2015-12-18 01:30:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7422910, 1171499, 113591, '<td valign="top">So small, yet so huge. To be stared at blankly for hours.</td>', 'So small, yet so huge. To be stared at blankly for hours.', '2015-12-18 01:31:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7422911, 1171361, 98565, '<td valign="top">A very creative and effective composition, I like it very much<br/>Congrats!</td>', 'A very creative and effective composition, I like it very muchCongrats!', '2015-12-18 01:36:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7422915, 1171393, 6519, '<td valign="top">I enjoyed this on so many levels:<br/> <br/>*Beautiful model.<br/>*B&amp;W is not something I am necessarily crazy about, but in this case it is perfect (and not just for hiding flaws, it is just RIGHT).<br/>*Lovely idea (recycled or not, it is still a great idea).<br/>*Fabulous execution.<br/> <br/>And then, to top it all off - another Lydia story, something I always enjoy in its own right.<br/> <br/>Well done...... I almost wish I hadn''t been so stingy with my vote (I was only one of your 9s instead of 10s).<br/></td>', 'I enjoyed this on so many levels: *Beautiful model.*B&W is not something I am necessarily crazy about, but in this case it is perfect (and not just for hiding flaws, it is just RIGHT).*Lovely idea (recycled or not, it is still a great idea).*Fabulous execution. And then, to top it all off - another Lydia story, something I always enjoy in its own right. Well done...... I almost wish I hadn''t been so stingy with my vote (I was only one of your 9s instead of 10s).', '2015-12-18 01:46:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7422927, 1171623, 159196, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the well deserved blue!</td>', 'Congrats on the well deserved blue!', '2015-12-18 04:37:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7422928, 1171585, 119419, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by clickodak:</b></div><hr/><i> Give 7 because a little lack of sharpness </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>the mind boggles</td>', 'Originally posted by clickodak: Give 7 because a little lack of sharpness   the mind boggles', '2015-12-18 05:33:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7422930, 1171613, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> Is that a white cover for her nipple that keeps drawing my attention?<br/> <br/>I wish there were a frame on the back wall... to make this clearly legal for the challenge topic.  I''m wondering what SC will do with there not being a frame for art or mirror in the image.<br/> <br/>The light is beautiful, as is your model. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That is just the play of the light at the edge of the areola.  No nipple cover.<br/> <br/>It is clearly legal, the window frame is a physical frame, although I wish I had one of them as well as clearly many people didn''t see it that way.</td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: Is that a white cover for her nipple that keeps drawing my attention? I wish there were a frame on the back wall... to make this clearly legal for the challenge topic.  I''m wondering what SC will do with there not being a frame for art or mirror in the image. The light is beautiful, as is your model.   That is just the play of the light at the edge of the areola.  No nipple cover. It is clearly legal, the window frame is a physical frame, although I wish I had one of them as well as clearly many people didn''t see it that way.', '2015-12-18 07:19:57.000000', NULL, 0),
